cations and internet services, implementing and enforcing policy provisions described in Lei 12.965/2014 and related governance processes. This is an example sentence supported by data references [Data: Relationships (593); Entities (593)]. The connection between Marco Civil and ANATEL is explicitly documented, illustrating how regulatory enforcement interfaces with the legal framework to ensure compliance and protection of user rights. This is an example sentence supported by data references [Data: Relationships (593); Entities (593)]. Additionally, the governance ecosystem references coordinated engagement with ANATEL through the Comite Gestor da Internet, underscoring ongoing regulatory collaboration. This is an example sentence supported by data references [Data: Relationships (596); Entities (592)].\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"summary\": \"Comite Gestor da Internet as a coordinating, multi-stakeholder body\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Comite Gestor da Internet (the Internet Steering Committee) coordinates multi-stakeholder input into Brazilian internet policy and governance, and it is noted to participate in governance processes with ANATEL. This is an example sentence supported by data references [Data: Entities (592); Relationships (596)]. The relationship indicates ongoing coordination between the Comite Gestor and ANATEL, illustrating how policy matters are deliberated within a broad stakeholder framework that aligns with Marco Civil objectives. This is an example sentence supported by data references [Data: Relationships (596); Entities (592)]. The structural role of the Comite Gestor in relation to the Marco Civil ecosystem is to facilitate policy development and oversight through inclusive governance mechanisms. This is an example sentence supported by data references [Data: Entities (592); Relationships (596)].\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"summary\": \"Cross-linking framework: BRASIL, Marco Civil, and the enforcement ecosystem\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Th